# Generated files are compared byte for byte by tools/build-css.mjs --check and
# tools/build-site.mjs --check, which write LF. With `* text=auto` alone, a fresh clone on
# Windows gets CRLF in the working tree and `npm run check` fails on a clean checkout.
* text=auto
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
_headers text eol=lf
.assetsignore text eol=lf
*.png binary
